        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-29T02:13:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is exactly what he does on his start side. Which is insanely crazy, which is why there are really only 2 methods of defeating him. The first one is to just rush in and deal as much damage as fast as possible, which is a very hard one to do. The other is to wait until he gets his drugs out so that way when he flips he will no longer heal.</p>",
