        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>lol, sorry I always have so many questions, but say, for example, you draw an environment card that says AT THE START OF THE ENVIRONMENT TURN, DO ____________....do you do it right away, or wait until the next Environment turn</p>",
