      {
        "id": 52685,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-29T03:51:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It will activate at the start of the next environment turn, if it is still around by then.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Environment turn has 3 steps to it:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ol>\n<li>Start of the Environment Turn</li>\n<li>Play an Environment Card</li>\n<li>End of the Environment Turn</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Since the playing of the environment card is after the start of the enviroment turn none of the start of environment turn effects on the played card&nbsp;would be able to trigger this time around.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:26:39.309Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 7127,
        "topic_slug": "spite-question",
        "display_username": "Ronway",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
