        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It will activate at the start of the next environment turn, if it is still around by then.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Environment turn has 3 steps to it:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ol><li>Start of the Environment Turn</li><li>Play an Environment Card</li><li>End of the Environment Turn</li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Since the playing of the environment card is after the start of the enviroment turn none of the start of environment turn effects on the played card&nbsp;would be able to trigger this time around.</p>",
