        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-29T09:22:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>An alternative, with Spite, with regards to avoiding his lifetap is to nerf his damage through, for example, multiple Stun Bolts. This way he keeps hitting people for zero damage (after reduction) and therefore can't regain anything. For this reason I'm fond of the Wraith when fighting him (she's pretty good in <span class=\"bbcode-i\">any</span> fight, though), though usually she ends up taking more damage due to the Nemesis bonus.</p>",
